# 统一换行，避免 Windows 上编辑后把 shell 脚本改成 CRLF 导致 CI 报 bad interpreter
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.plist text eol=lf
*.pbxproj text eol=lf
*.xcscheme text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# 设计稿与图标是二进制，禁止行尾转换与 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
